      "message": "I think zune-jpeg batching can exceed that: `max_scanline_stripe_rows()` uses something like `(DCT_BLOCK_SIZE + 1) * max_v` which IIUC can yield 36.  Should be bump the value to 36 to avoid triggering zune\u0027s buffered mode?",
